MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_001: How Esmeralda continues to prattle on about you—\na never-ending stream of banal observations!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_002: For my part, I am free from this obsession with\nthe opposite sex.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_003: The distinction between male and female holds no\nmeaning for me whatsoever.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_004: When I received my Heart Core some three thousand\nyears ago, the concept of a lifespan lost all meaning.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_005: Since that time, I have devoted my attention to the\npursuit of scientific research.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_006: The Heart Core, or higher-dimension quantum\nreactor, is the crystallization of human wisdom.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_007: Every time I feel it within me, I am filled with pride.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01_008: By extending my span, it liberates me from the need\nto replicate myself in the form of offspring.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c11_Fab_m01: <BLN>Enough, I say.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_001: Hey, Sweetie. How do I look?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_002: I think my skin looks GREAT! Better than ever.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_003: <NCA>Agree.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_004: <NCB>Profess an inability to tell.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_005: <ACA>We walked around that desert for so long and took a\nlot of sun, so I was kind of worried.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_006: <ACA>Maybe the balm I got from Leda helped?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_007: <ACB>Easy for you to say! Your skin is flawless. Some girls\nhave to put in a little work!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_008: Maybe it's time to make an investment in Anna's\nbeauty cream? She was talking it up...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_009: She has special connections. It's next to impossible to\nget it, she said, but she's holding some for me!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_010: I guess I ought to buy it, right? It could help!
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01_011: But...it costs more than a thousand gold. Can I really\nafford it?
MID_LGA_1DIT_c11_Esm_m01: <BLN>What do I do?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_001: You've probably heard by now about how I made a\nname for myself as a mercenary.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_002: Thing is, it wasn't that great.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_003: Because what "making your name" means is killing a\nlot of people.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_004: And thanks to that, I would run out of fingers to\ncount with before I'd run out of enemies to count.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_005: Even now, people track me down to try and settle\ntheir scores.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_006: I've even had to deal with the grown son of an\nold foe turning up.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_007: That kind of thing gets to me. It's hard to keep your\nhead on straight after something like that.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01_008: I'm whining, aren't I? That doesn't befit the name\nMikaela Redblade!
MID_LGA_1DIT_c11_Mic_m01: <BLN>Some things, you don't get over.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Set_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Set_m01_001: Well done, battling this far. You're putting your\nshare of the blood from the 10 Elites to use.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Set_m01_002: Your next opponent is the White-Maned Demon,\ncorrect? He's strong. You had best be wary.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Set_m01_003: For the record, I'm not cheering you on. I just don't\nwant you to exit at this point.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_Set_m01_004: I will continue to assess you—how you think and\nact under each new circumstance.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c11_Set_m01: <BLN>I continue to assess you.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01: <TH>
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01_001: Why am I cheering you on, you ask?
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01_002: Hm...
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01_003: The truth is...it might just be my own selfishness.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01_004: I feel that, watching you, I can become\nstronger myself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01_005: I may be cheering myself on when I cheer you on—\nand only myself.
MID_LGV_1DIT_c11_B01_m01_006: I am sorry if you find this awkward.
MID_LGA_1DIT_c11_B01_m01: <BLN>What can I say?